5. PRIVACY

The Software runs entirely on your computer. It contains no analytics, no crash
reporting, no telemetry and no network client: it makes no outbound connections
of any kind. It reads the folders you nominate and writes its own index,
settings and logs to your user profile. Nothing is transmitted anywhere. See
PRIVACY.md for the detail.


